{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>一連三晚《農夫全香港最好笑嘅演唱會》今晚（9日）於紅館進行第2場表演，全晚高潮莫過於「農夫御用嘉賓」麥玲玲師傅壓軸登場。玲玲姐今次玩轉形象</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260509/1129925493538164736267438.jpeg/cWSCtrH8dsxjJaFL9N4ImUVLqrgReKxvxfCWpuPwlqY\" alt=\"農夫演唱會！（黃梓恒攝）\"><figcaption>農夫演唱會！（黃梓恒攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260509/1129925799458246656015286.jpeg/abwSiRSVcSrp0kdZpOxOw2Sb3eBqlVCpYqOUyUSjlMk\" alt=\"玲玲師傅化身Hip Hop Queen震撼全場。（黃梓恒攝）\"><figcaption>玲玲師傅化身Hip Hop Queen震撼全場。（黃梓恒攝）</figcaption></figure><p>除了玲玲師傅，今晚更有MC張天賦做嘉賓，同農夫一齊唱出《學海無涯》。不過講到震撼，最後古天樂出場令到全場尖叫，原來古老闆正式投資了農夫新開的公司，所以「農作天下」才有天下兩個字。最後三人更合唱《天命最高》，在一片尖叫聲中，結束今場演唱會。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260509/1129925802507636736024516.jpeg/JhZRySewqm_OlHSOtOo1BhH-AVjf9h2AHhKDZDgSg2Q\" alt=\"MC出場。（黃梓恒攝）\"><figcaption>MC出場。（黃梓恒攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260509/1129925797063168000165047.jpeg/_-qqg5c5Q0xzMx_kzSuQy-FrE2F_upXKH0hqdDlIanQ\" alt=\"MC出場。（黃梓恒攝）\"><figcaption>MC出場。（黃梓恒攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260509/1129925711826784256370846.jpeg/JMGWIg8-TV31_xz0M3uWUFFAuWbdSW0Pua27cZ-tu3E\" alt=\"嘩！古天樂做嘉賓呀！（黃梓恒攝）\"><figcaption>嘩！古天樂做嘉賓呀！（黃梓恒攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260509/1129925709138104320036791.jpeg/meVfJBuq7wGjhDbPEv14fJDjYBm6SFjCO3Wm4h11puI\" alt=\"原來古天樂係農夫新老闆！（黃梓恆 攝）\"><figcaption>原來古天樂係農夫新老闆！（黃梓恆 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260509/1129925706399092736805172.jpeg/NiOAaWpGpi_el85j2Km7CmlKsWqizQ7AGWFw5z9hcOc\" alt=\"原來古天樂係農夫新老闆！（黃梓恒攝）\"><figcaption>原來古天樂係農夫新老闆！（黃梓恒攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-09T16:09:45.836455+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":7,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}